# Content / CMS

- PostgreSQL (Prisma) is the source of truth for website and dashboard content.
- Do not add Sanity, GROQ, or Studio. Do not reintroduce `next-sanity`.
- Never expose `DATABASE_URL`, write tokens, or auth secrets to the browser.
- User passwords must be hashed. Never store plaintext passwords in PostgreSQL.
- Do not add doors as a Nora Group service.
- Localized JSON copy uses `{ he, ar, en, ru }`. Do not drop `ru` on write.
